{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:frame-matrix","title":"def:frame-matrix","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":1426,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#def:frame-matrix","uses":[],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"def:frame-matrix","line":2411,"source":"\\begin{definition}[The Matrix of $g$ in a Frame]\n\\label{def:frame-matrix}\n\n\n\n\nFor a local frame $(Y_1,\\ldots,Y_n)$ on $u$, the matrix of $g$ at $x\\in u$ is\n\\[\ng_{ij}(x)=\\langle Y_i|_x,Y_j|_x\\rangle_g.\n\\]\nFor a coordinate frame this is the coordinate matrix $(g_{ij})$.\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[The Matrix of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g$\">$g$</span> in a Frame] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a6672616d652d6d6174726978\"></span> <p></p>For a local frame <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(Y_1,\\ldots ,Y_n)$\">$(Y_1,\\ldots ,Y_n)$</span> on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$u$\">$u$</span>, the matrix of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g$\">$g$</span> at <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x\\in u$\">$x\\in u$</span> is <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  g_{ij}(x)=\\langle Y_i|_x,Y_j|_x\\rangle _g.  \\]\">\\[  g_{ij}(x)=\\langle Y_i|_x,Y_j|_x\\rangle _g.  \\]</span> For a coordinate frame this is the coordinate matrix <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(g_{ij})$\">$(g_{ij})$</span>. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:volume-form-smooth","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/c