-matrix}\n\n\n\n\nFor a local frame $(Y_1,\\ldots,Y_n)$ on $u$, the matrix of $g$ at $x\\in u$ is\n\\[\ng_{ij}(x)=\\langle Y_i|_x,Y_j|_x\\rangle_g.\n\\]\nFor a coordinate frame this is the coordinate matrix $(g_{ij})$.\n\\end{definition}","source":"tex/references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","description":"","dependencies":[],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}